  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Placering av &#xe5;klagarexpert p&#xe5; CPCC i Bryssel</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Prosecution Expert</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Bidra med arbete med strategiska fr&#xe5;gor avseende fredsfr&#xe4;mjande insatser med m&#xe5;lbild att f&#xe5; mer &#xe5;klagarperspektiv i planering av den fredsfr&#xe4;mjande verksamheten i EU:s missioner.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To contribute to strategic questions regarding peace promoting with the goal to have also a prosecutor perspective in the planning of the operation of the peace promoting part of the EU missions</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Placement of a prosecutor&apos;s expert at the CPCC in Brussels (EU headquarters for civilian crisis management in predominantly low and middle-income countries). The expert will work on rule of law issues which aim to strengthen democratic institutions in all countries in which EU crisis management operations operate. Since the work is strategic, the effects are long-term and can affect, for example, the life expectancy of people in the operating countries.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Placering av &#xe5;klagarexpert p&#xe5; CPCC i Bryssel (EUs h&#xf6;gkvarter f&#xf6;r civil krishantering i f&#xf6;retr&#xe4;delsevis l&#xe5;g- och medelinkomstl&#xe4;nder). Experten kommer att arbeta med r&#xe4;ttsstatsfr&#xe5;gor vilket syftar till att st&#xe4;rka demokratiska institutioner i alla l&#xe4;nder som EU:s krishanteringsinsatser &#xe4;r verksamma i. D&#xe5; arbetet &#xe4;r strategiskt &#xe4;r effekterna l&#xe5;ngsiktiga och kan p&#xe5;verka exempelvis livsl&#xe4;ngden p&#xe5; m&#xe4;nniskorna i operationsl&#xe4;nderna.</narrative>
  </description>
